Kodi Manager: find an add-on setting from your browser.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Start with your Kodi dashboard.
Use a browser on your phone or computer.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Search across your add-ons.
Type a setting name — here, “quality”.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Find the setting and its add-on.
This example finds “Highest quality” in POV.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Open the matching add-on.
Inspect the settings in one browser page.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:33,000
